  "title": "Erdős Problem #1109",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $f(N)$ be the size of the largest subset $A\\subseteq \\{1,\\ldots,N\\}$ such that every $n\\in A+A$ is squarefree. Estimate $f(N)$. In particular, is it true that $f(N)\\leq N^{o(1)}$, or even $f(N) \\leq (\\log N)^{O(1)}$?",
